{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02248","headline":"杂曲歌辞 宫中行乐词 三 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 宫中行乐词 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卢橘爲秦树，蒲萄出汉宫。\n烟花宜落日，丝管醉春风。\n笛奏龙鸣水，箫吟凤下空。\n君王多乐事，何必向回中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}